                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4b9b2fc6-ceeb-42f3-9d71-9b40233cbcda",
                        "entry_id": "304a0db9-3f17-3ed3-aa1a-c064c5871f92",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "sunrisers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1e8625c1-93e5-3d9c-b78b-f761d019b51a",
                        "entry_id": "304a0db9-3f17-3ed3-aa1a-c064c5871f92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An early riser who gets up at dawn."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da5ab897-602f-452e-8b5f-130ca1a38664",
                                "sense_id": "1e8625c1-93e5-3d9c-b78b-f761d019b51a",
                                "text": "He was up with the first “sunrisers” and his ax was the last to break the stillness at night."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1be018ce-5bf8-4c9b-bb52-086ba555679d",
                                "sense_id": "1e8625c1-93e5-3d9c-b78b-f761d019b51a",
                                "text": "When he woke that morning she was sitting up. That in itself was unusual, for Joseph is a sunriser."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddaa4b92-8d85-41bd-bcf0-50ef16df0566",
                                "sense_id": "1e8625c1-93e5-3d9c-b78b-f761d019b51a",
                                "text": "For the ambitious passengers there is always the opportunity to jog around the deck followed up by an early sunriser's breakfast."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8fa7b71-aba3-4a9e-9ae3-855268cb1ce8",
                                "sense_id": "1e8625c1-93e5-3d9c-b78b-f761d019b51a",
                                "text": "The moonshiners are now only a memory, but the sunrisers have grown into many hundreds, with trailers and campers pulling into Red Rock Canyon days early for a good parking spot."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c81e5a1f-8683-3ddc-9c6e-ec766b8e79bd",
                        "entry_id": "304a0db9-3f17-3ed3-aa1a-c064c5871f92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An alcoholic beverage drunk early in the morning."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "216c6936-6cfe-4c30-8220-1b0d30c55262",
                                "sense_id": "c81e5a1f-8683-3ddc-9c6e-ec766b8e79bd",
                                "text": "Stefan took out a brandy flask. \"Would you like a sunriser?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0d8f24a-ac1e-4cb5-ad29-2815dd5586d1",
                                "sense_id": "c81e5a1f-8683-3ddc-9c6e-ec766b8e79bd",
                                "text": "So far as I could see, the African resident likes a sunriser, an eleven o'clocker, an appetizer before lunch, a great many sundowners, and a few nightcaps."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ffa93627-05ec-37d7-a715-4799379d4003",
                        "entry_id": "304a0db9-3f17-3ed3-aa1a-c064c5871f92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who likes novelty and change; one who is optimistic about new endeavors."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0430cc16-8edd-49a1-9bd8-20955c14d403",
                                "sense_id": "ffa93627-05ec-37d7-a715-4799379d4003",
                                "text": "What causes this resistance is among the great mysterious defects of national life. But is it, as the sunrisers claim, diminishing in its obstructive force?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c57026d2-69d8-474c-af5d-f50ffeb0f253",
                                "sense_id": "ffa93627-05ec-37d7-a715-4799379d4003",
                                "text": "Those who put priority on promoting high tech industry (sunrisers) and those who emphasized the need to protect declining industries (sunsetters) were unable to agree on a common approach."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bab51ada-7a04-49bd-87c0-85e6fd234a15",
                                "sense_id": "ffa93627-05ec-37d7-a715-4799379d4003",
                                "text": "A sunriser goes through life open to the idea that the best may still be coming."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
